 "title": "Grain Services | VanTilburg Farms",
 "text": "-->\nGrain Services | VanTilburg Farms\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nVanTilburg Farms\nHome\nAbout Us\nOur Businesses\nServices\nCrop Insurance\nGrain Services\nAg Retail & Services\nExcavation\nWeather\nCareers\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nGrain Services\nWith 700,000 bushels of storage space and a 1,100 bushel grain pit for quick and easy unloading, VanTilburg Farms, Inc. is the perfect place to market your grain. We accept traited and untraited soybeans (Enlist E3, Roundup Ready, conventional, Xtend, etc). However, corn must be non-GMO. We offer a variety of contracts to meet each individuals, or farms' specific needs. Our Market and Grain Specialist, Baily VanTilburg, provides a daily look at the current prices and always puts the customer first, trying to earn them the highest profit possible on their grain sales.\nContact Us\nCall Before You Haul\nWe ONLY accept contracted non-GMO corn as needed. We accept ALL types of soybeans\nClick to Call Us!\nCorn Non-GMO Requirements\nCBOT Prices\nGrain Storage\nGrain Contracts\n©2020 by VanTilburg Farms.\nbottom of page",
